-- Groq provider (Open space, the user's own key). Additive only: seeds the Groq chat rows into provider_models (migration 0029 created the table). Generated from src/providers/seed.ts:
--   bun scripts/gen-provider-seed.ts groq   (test/provider-catalog.test.ts + test/groq-provider.test.ts fail if this drifts from the seed)
-- Rows carry: price_json (list-price ESTIMATE with a source; a price without a source is ignored), limits_json (context/maxTokens/maxOutput + the free-tier rpm/rpd/tpm/tpd from the provider dashboard),
-- extra_json (shortContext = history is trimmed to the per-minute token budget, parallelTools, reasoningEffort, maxImages, imageTokens). Not seeded as chat on purpose: whisper, orpheus, prompt-guard, safeguard, allam.
-- APPLY BEFORE relying on it: `wrangler d1 migrations apply <db> --remote`. Until then the code serves the identical built-in seed. Rollback = DELETE FROM provider_models WHERE provider_id='groq' (or redeploy the previous Worker).
